@host = http://localhost:5080

### Calculate (fired)
POST {{host}}/api/calculations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": {
    "startDate": "2021-03-01", "endDate": "2026-09-28", "monthlySalary": 16500, "jobPercent": 100,
    "workDaysPerWeek": 5, "vacationBalanceDays": 9, "recuperationDaysPaidLastYear": 0,
    "section14": "Partial6", "hasStudyFund": true
  },
  "reason": "Fired"
}

### Compare fired vs resigned
POST {{host}}/api/calculations/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{ "profile": { "startDate": "2021-03-01", "endDate": "2026-09-28", "monthlySalary": 16500, "jobPercent": 100, "workDaysPerWeek": 5, "vacationBalanceDays": 9, "recuperationDaysPaidLastYear": 0, "section14": "Partial6", "hasStudyFund": true } }

### Checklist
GET {{host}}/api/checklist?reason=Resigned

### Sources
GET {{host}}/api/sources
